# 3D closed flexible bag (cylinder R = 5 m, floor at z = 2.5 m, depth 6 m), top edge held, inner level +5 cm,
# strongly coupled (coupling iterated; membrane mesh 1.5 delta and Robin factor 16 by default)
membrane cylinder 12.0 12.0 5.0 2.5 7.0
name cylbag
resistance 1.0e4
projections 2
fill 0.05
print 1.0
structure flexible
mass 1.0
density 1300
stiffness 5.0e5
damping 0.1
coupling iterated
